  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading of the prevention and response system and mechanisms in cases of threats to the safety and life of female and male journalists in Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims at increasing the safety of media workers, which contributes to the consistent application of the National Media Strategy, strengthening freedom of expression and improving the quality of media content in Serbia. This supports the broader goal of fostering a democratic society where journalists can work freely and safely.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
